/ Private images (PrivateImagesController#index), under Apps: the tokens the NAS keeps for images
/ their owners keep private, and the form to add one or replace one.
p.kai-apps-back
  a href=apps_index_path(anchor: 'add')
    = lucide_icon('chevron-left', size: 16)
    | All apps

.kai-custom.kai-private-images
  p.kai-custom-lede
    | An image its owner keeps private downloads only with a token from its registry. The NAS keeps
      each token where only the system can read it, uses it only for images that start with its
      place, and never shows it again. Your apps never see it.
  = render 'tokens', from: nil
  = render 'form', from: nil

= javascript_include_tag 'private_images'
